   "translation": {
    "literal": "Bring forth for the bright, the radiant one, your offering and [your] thought, well purified, to Agni, who goes with knowledge among all births, divine and human.",
    "readable": "Offer to Agni, bright and radiant, your purified offering and your prayer — to him who passes knowingly among all the generations of gods and men."
